  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>A grooming salon located right in the centre of Cavalaire-sur-Mer since 1994, handy for a freshen-up before or after a day at the beach. The salon offers full grooming as well as a selection of accessories for dogs and cats, with good consistent reviews on two platforms (about 4.7/5), citing the welcome, the attentiveness and prices considered reasonable.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The salon is closed on weekends — plan your slot during the week, especially during the summer season when appointments go fast. Booking by phone is recommended.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: if you're planning to combine beach and grooming, allow plenty of time in summer — the salon closes for a midday break like many businesses in the area.</div>

      <h2>Services and shop</h2>
      <p>Petit Futé details the salon's services: canine hygiene and aesthetics, eye and ear cleaning, clipping, scissor cut and stripping. The shop sells food (Pro Plan brand mentioned), carry bags, cushions, collars, harnesses, leashes, shampoos, care products and clothing. Payment methods listed: cash and cheque. The Cavalaire tourist office listing places the salon on avenue Charles de Gaulle, immeuble Les Régates, and shows it open all year.</p>

      <h2>Check before you go</h2>
      <p>No website or phone number published by the salon was found: hours and services come from directories (Petit Futé, Cylex). Prices not published. Directory hours: Monday to Friday, 8:30am-12pm and 2:30-6pm; closed on weekends.</p>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Cavalaire town centre, its shops and its market are just a stone's throw away, so you can get two things done while your dog gets pampered.</p>
